{
 "about": "Controller colour variants for the app art (site_variants.py, variant_materials.py), in display order: standard colours, then special editions. Colours are photo estimates, brought onto the model's calibration in variant_materials.linear. No logos, artwork, symbols or brand marks: only colour schemes, finishes and simple procedural patterns. approach: solid (the colour's own plain colours and finish), scheme-only (a printed edition reduced to its colour scheme), original-pattern (our own procedural pattern evoking the edition's look in colour, density and placement; nothing traced). The default white is the shipped art and has no recipe.",
